<title>UK: Smithkline climbs after ADR strength.</title>
<headline>Smithkline climbs after ADR strength.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Plc led UK drug stocks higher on Wednesday after strong gains in its ADRs in New York and amid positive press comment on yesterday's results, traders said.</p>
<p>Shares in SmithKline rose 24-1/2p to 919p by 0926 GMT. SmithKline ADRs were up $3-1/8 at $75 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
